{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ScanKit 是一款快速又現代化的文件掃描工具，適合學生、上班族、自由工作者、教師及小型企業使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可將發票、合約、筆記、書籍、名片及證件等文件迅速掃描、整理並分享。</p>\n\n<h2>智慧文件掃描與 PDF 製作</h2>\n<p>ScanKit 自動偵測文件邊緣並智慧裁剪，提供透視修正與多頁連續掃描。內建 OCR 文字辨識可擷取並搜尋文件內容，更可將掃描結果建立成多頁 PDF，調整頁面順序、旋轉或壓縮大小，支援黑白、彩色、灰階等模式增強畫面清晰度，並可一鍵分享或列印。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-538-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-539-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-540-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-541-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-542-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-543-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ScanKit: Document &amp; QR Scanner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T18:58:54.905399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}